PDF not generated locally — LaTeX is not installed on this machine.

To compile locally before arXiv submission:

    brew install --cask mactex-no-gui   ***REMOVED*** or basictex for a smaller footprint
    ***REMOVED*** then:
    cd release/arxiv/c1-unified-preprint-v0.3/
    pdflatex main.tex
    pdflatex main.tex                    ***REMOVED*** second pass for cross-refs

The references in main.tex are inlined (no \cite{}/\bibliography{} yet),
so a bibtex pass is NOT required at this stage. references.bib is
shipped alongside for future use if you decide to switch to bibtex.

Alternatively, upload main.tex + references.bib directly to arXiv and
let arXiv's TeXLive compile it server-side — this is the most reliable
path and is what arXiv expects.
